<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">DATA CONNECTOR</text><text class="hero-title">接入自有条文</text><text class="hero-desc">支持数组 JSON，自动映射常用字段。</text></view><view class="card"><view class="notice">支持字段：lawName / articleNo / title / content / keywords / chapter / effective / source。也支持 law、article、text、name 等别名。</view><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="粘贴 JSON 数据" value="{{text}}" bindinput="onInput"></textarea><view style="display:flex;gap:16rpx"><button class="chip" bindtap="example">填入示例</button><button class="primary" style="flex:1;margin-top:0" bindtap="importData">导入并建立索引</button></view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="analysis">{{message}}</view></view></view>
